  "description": "A TSX/JSX view engine for ASP.NET Core. Write views as .tsx or .jsx files and return them from controllers or minimal APIs. Compiled by the native TypeScript compiler and served as native ES modules with no bundler, rendered on the client, on the server, or both. Includes synchronous .NET interop from server-rendered views, TypeScript types generated from your .NET models, and hot reload in development.",
